.DS_Store
node_modules/
*.log

# Build output and tool caches, regenerated by the CLI / Studio (every project)
**/renders/
**/.hyperframes/
**/.thumbnails/
**/.waveform-cache/

# media-use download cache: big catalog audio. The copies a video really uses live in <project>/assets/.
# .media/manifest.jsonl and .media/index.md stay tracked: they record where each track came from.
**/.media/audio/

